      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR FREEDOM (2) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (22.69) at Townsville in a Maiden. Lines up from box 2 for the first time. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Leading chance again. COSMO CHARLIE (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.18) at this track behind Marzhew in a Grade 6/MDN. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Expected to be in the finish again. LITTLE HILL (8) improved her time on first attempt here at the trip with a 8 length third in 24.00 latest. Bold showing expected again. FARMOR MYSTERY (4) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to atone.",
